A lean4export NDJSON stream checked as the arena runs `sokonanoda --stdin
--nat-extension --string-extension --axiom-allow-all`, on one thread:
Config::to_export_file_from_bytes (new: parses from memory as a mapped
file is parsed, with the same panic-to-error mapping as to_export_file),
then check_all_declars. sokonanoda rejects and declines by panicking with
Rejection/Decline payloads; the fuzzing build aborts on panic, so a panic
hook (installed from a static constructor) ends the test case through
wasmfuzz's exit_testcase import for those payloads. Any other panic is a
finding.
Upstream: none (no fuzz targets upstream, checked 2026-11-22).

